[en.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_ARMY]
Youth Enlistment

[en.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_ARMY_desc]
Only when you are the holder of the Element of Honesty, your words are 100% trustable.\nOnly when you are the holder of a large ideology army ready to go at any time, your enemy’s words are 100% trustable.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_ARMY]
青年入伍

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_ARMY_desc]
只有当你拥有诚实之元素时，你的话语才是100%可信的。\n只有当你拥有一支庞大的意识形态军队蓄势待发时，你的敌人的话语才是100%可信的。

